{"job_id":"F-003cd84c2151494603ae","family_id":"F-003cd84c2151494603ae","title":"새마을운동조직 육성법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":11,"target_id":"279189ecb1af9ed7150ed55b07c6d1ede101c940c26e718988d0c1e4641fd1cd","source_hash":"77d2bbf8ab085fcef0b6c1adb3ebfa0ac96eea11d19cd7857289728e0ffb4a8d","text":"新村运动组织促进法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":103,"target_id":"1104df60bbc9e013beb24d9874b3d94403e6d9bd328de8b3706048fb586bb53e","source_hash":"7d4cb132ef43d0f50cab19546c172b0cb9b0e0988826ebe406d89c49b5127fa7","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是促进新村运动的不断进步和完善，并通过支持和扶持由人民自愿运动组成的新村运动组织，为国家和社会发展做出贡献。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":103,"end":258,"target_id":"f3475b13d36c99c1445164421d8086e53a13230ac4b3574b747d250bc94201dd","source_hash":"184eae6fd9b8341c981b2d4c7e7e2e935b5d15850ee463774661624bfb112b2e","text":"第二条（定义）本法中，“新村运动组织”一词是指新村运动中央协会及其附属组织，如新村领导人中央委员会、新村妇女协会中央联合会、工作场所和工厂新村运动中央委员会、新村图书馆中央协会，以及其他与新村运动有关的组织及其附属组织，以及经主管部长授权成立的法人团体。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":258,"end":696,"target_id":"f947d575324dd84224914d09d65db572fedca4cb71bba052d423e7ddd3678147","source_hash":"831c676c73631d7fccccd1d1cf281a5a36e8f6f0203fc5bb1af32429acb1fb0a","text":"第三条（缴纳会费等）\n① 国家或地方政府可以提供捐款和补贴，以支付新村运动组织运作所需的费用。\n② 国家或地方政府可以补贴新村运动组织海外合作项目的全部或部分费用。<2019年12月10日新增>\n③ 个人、公司和组织可以捐赠资金或其他财产作为运营资金，以支持和促进新村运动组织的运作。<2019年12月10日修订>\n④ 新村运动组织可以设立储备基金，该基金由捐款或捐赠资助，用于特定用途，并与其他组织账户分开核算。<2019年12月10日修订>\n⑤ 根据第1至4款的规定，有关捐款、补贴和捐赠的使用和管理以及储备金运作的必要事项，由总统令规定。<2019年12月10日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":696,"end":848,"target_id":"860b5fe498e336537e826329175ee4759d7665f72a815e985e843df8f28fc905","source_hash":"21aa2dd31b959c045191e0955a306a30cb9399df5ca6ba30378e6a55c6ecfffb","text":"第四条（国有和公共财产的租赁等）为促进新村运动组织发展，国家或地方政府可以按照总统令的规定，无偿租赁或转让国有或公共财产，或者允许其使用或享用，即使《国家财产法》或《公共财产和物资管理法》另有规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":848,"end":1003,"target_id":"5f364cad3e40983687ec4c6ed86974400ee02a83c37075b0e0bd7235e15227ff","source_hash":"fea1bf41fc04ea0796e4e3b640a161d4e8b875c203b645320855a8fb3d03d2a0","text":"第五条（免税等）\n① 政府应当按照《特别税限制法》的规定，给予新村运动组织税收豁免和减免。\n② 根据《新村运动》第三条第三款规定，向新村运动组织捐赠或捐献的财产，适用《特别税限制法》规定的特别税收待遇。<2019年12月10日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1003,"end":1308,"target_id":"e42cf5f7071ed1f4f2d9c9d04894d456779b02b119affcaa1254999b816ad0bb","source_hash":"1bf319157de82e6145d4163b628265ee7a0dab6656f5a36e07fc6dc9001a2b29","text":"第六条（请求派遣新村运动人员等）\n① 新村运动中央协会在认为为实现其目标特别必要时，可通过内政安全部长官请求各级行政机关及与新村运动相关的法人或组织派遣新村运动人员。<2013年3月23日、2014年11月19日、2017年7月26日修订>\n② 收到根据第1款提出的派遣请求的机构或组织的负责人应当遵照执行，除非有特殊理由不遵照执行。\n③ 根据第2款派遣的人员在派遣期间应视为在其原所属机构工作，并且不应因派遣而受到不利待遇。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1308,"end":1410,"target_id":"78d23954e7d97ca343b0f87b67df3617dca1cbf42bc09d00b4aeca6c850ca8c7","source_hash":"4be6e853bb62914caeb9ff38bf7402e4963810ae9aef09fcb3af686c2ef7acb1","text":"第七条（请求提供资料）新村运动组织可以请求国家、公共实体、教育机构和研究机构提供与新村运动有关的出版物，如研究论文、调查报告等资料。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1410,"end":1493,"target_id":"d36476f3a3df2d384de413365ce3b50325485830dc0a2a98827142783f16002f","source_hash":"ca7299e830aa5542b3b3742ffd5961a64211a9060ac66e554244aeb23a785f11","text":"第八条（宣传资料的出版）新村运动组织在必要时可以出版宣传资料，以传播新村运动的思想和成功案例，并引导公众。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1493,"end":1637,"target_id":"4f80785e8047cd157d7654a0f4a676ba082193e75018b9d8aa6974707da1d0e6","source_hash":"f964f5ad61477e1439cc0f6135817ba8c943c6af8a948f41838c6f2d1f12d233","text":"Article 8-2 (Saemaul Day)\n① 为了不断推进新村运动，提高公众对该运动的兴趣，每年的4月22日被定为新村日。\n② 国家和地方政府应当按照第1款的规定，努力开展适合新村日的活动等项目。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1637,"end":1737,"target_id":"004c72dc5353ef21e155884aa8ba81e71ef593828d5407d58b6efa4dd804136a","source_hash":"079646602f7515a90416f269ef4b77e0afeb1a82dd1608420a188018f627c7dc","text":"第九条（提交预算等）  新村运动组织应在每个财政年度开始前，编制并向主管部长提交下一年度的业务计划和预算。修改时亦应如此。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1737,"end":1830,"target_id":"1d77b027de3924e0f3a3cc9acff5ad4fa79d103137e712561e8bba537c86940f","source_hash":"1cfe992591ae008f63f19b33257e8309ab9ecd39e23f04642e539824b0aee145","text":"第十条（结算报告等）新村运动组织应当在每个财政年度结束后的次年三月底之前，向主管部长提交该财政年度的收支结算报告，并附上该年度的经营业绩结果。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1830,"end":1851,"target_id":"69d753573c854f5934681e279c8bc01602e2af20ba933fd092590a09d52aa1c5","source_hash":"b38edd572d8aa40f57731dc61be4d182e6e6e89fcfbf3183d01aa108a69fd803","text":"文章 11 已删除 <2011.5.30>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1851,"end":1992,"target_id":"ff69b19162dfb48ec976d06da68f41246756d38e1adb99952baa751866d90334","source_hash":"29191ed505e97b7223b202342edaba3e6482e0ac6bbd1b5527b1f7625e9c10ba","text":"补充规定 <第3269号，1980年12月13日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（过渡措施）在本法实施时，国家或地方政府为建立新村运动组织而提供的任何资金或其他财产，均应视为根据本法第三条第一款规定提供的捐赠财产。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1992,"end":2025,"target_id":"a03a60157c9d53d8e92cfc360919c5fa0b7d7d4b1973e02176a0b673638f0f49","source_hash":"140549c20710009c223877e46deca19f2f927c0ba9a0fb28828ab2a8a463a7b4","text":"附录（基金管理框架法）<1999年12月31日第6101号法案>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2025,"end":2068,"target_id":"171679ac45e139f1b8d4f5dcfc617ec9b82298e8c94a39906b885bf5dce34fa9","source_hash":"e557ba4996cf9ead8c0c48daee8925f0da8d2fb243dd12f864f4e6ca41f5d9ea","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自2000年1月1日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2068,"end":2076,"target_id":"e477b78e6b2ad91f579a43aae04a10244810604f0f74b0c94396e5ab91b74a5c","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2076,"end":2405,"target_id":"6edfcc58aa0050d92015f3f63a4b5f334fcab70b4f3fdf6043213c94792fb2e9","source_hash":"9a846244545854ada5429e2c24d55a5ea9d589878f5190bbbb4bc5151dc7239f","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至② 已省略\n\n③《新村运动组织促进法》修改如下。\n\n  第三条第一款中的“基金设立和运作”改为“运作”，第二款中的“新村运动基金和运作资源”改为“运作资源”。第三款修改如下，并新增第四款如下。\n\n    ③ 新村运动组织可以设立储备基金，该基金由捐款或捐赠资助，用于特定用途，并与该组织的其他账户分开核算。\n\n    ④ 根据第1款至第3款的规定，有关捐款、补贴和捐赠的使用和管理以及储备金运作的必要事项，由总统令规定。\n\n④ 至 <22> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2405,"end":2413,"target_id":"5895e2d29875163ff8b3ec4494eba85f353f003d019103c3d3c74877d99f1999","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2413,"end":2443,"target_id":"bf19f51464c03ea277487a6edef7ec009bd68685a61c665575f6e4ac279814f3","source_hash":"9f984faffebd91642f1e26e75c1ab3649e306236dd38deee54e7ee1495f626a6","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第8852号法令，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2443,"end":2576,"target_id":"3e8098d91b09d8cbb91687db21b51ff83f5d835e996a7c4648f62b77e267f5ca","source_hash":"521d8e5ab1ea8ad1965b0fa0941c6967f3b0e929ccafe8637d1746922053d134","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……，根据补充条例第六条修正的、在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律部分，自各法律的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2576,"end":2593,"target_id":"550f2a7c65ff4c94a0b223c6b63364d32d23172998b93633734f4f53c4ab3b48","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2593,"end":2725,"target_id":"78a575f015c1b621ce86225be427b23481d01c859b58501ea778b172bb5de34d","source_hash":"dd5fb6b3363144de5ff56c083bf1dc333fc505b0ae748d601fedc0f45e312d26","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<208> 已省略\n\n  《促进新村运动组织法》部分修订如下。\n\n  第六条第一款中的“内政部长”应改为“公共行政和安全部长”。\n\n  <210> 至 <760> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2725,"end":2733,"target_id":"fe0d8001bca9657e54c3599b9626235f9f3494459ace2563cac9b45bad656f4d","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2733,"end":2776,"target_id":"add7859581ad609c1dc76376a655090bbe2d7dca3e9ec827d89ce5c03aaa483e","source_hash":"ee2c899f0923dcfa048fa8164e60f1549cba8f31b4f1861251b9be26d4e50929","text":"补充规定 <第10438号，2011年3月8日>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2776,"end":2820,"target_id":"6449eea1d6c9f9195b1b68003b7ac2a26c71f242d4d52847ed8a4e78a7b2de6e","source_hash":"3b1ba32b9e787711db7503861974127fb83185d94bd106ab14a0812fb3dd997e","text":"补充规定 <第10729号，2011年5月30日>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2820,"end":2851,"target_id":"defd89836fca0e79ab32bd5f7e33a2b906a6e2e10bbec40d009d5c6e3b0e4be0","source_hash":"884b1766aaddfed62f208e70764e5d43694b510475476512e06be6a0808c47af","text":"补充条款（政府组织法）<第11690号法令，2013年3月23日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2851,"end":2890,"target_id":"797b54a26e051d4bdc60d147e6a22d24e8f261fbb8228456a35f08aeb353aec2","source_hash":"7cf406f7704ce6d066ca16497c901e20fe59d4073e2a4ca44a0e7113ba477553","text":"第一条（生效日期）① 本法自公布之日起生效。 \n\n  ②省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2890,"end":2907,"target_id":"e0e7ff8978d296dfb694731bf5cf86b756cceef6b3764173dcc70beb606ee81e","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2907,"end":3037,"target_id":"aed126073dfda049f99506ce7e65a0777c582637a205bb6ef1069f894e704f3f","source_hash":"2457877eb4f30aea682a42c88869d1eb69ee2da474bd5a60f7ae82af949beced","text":"第六条（其他法律的修正）①至<176>款已省略\n\n  《促进新村运动组织法》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第六条第一款中，“公共行政和安全部长”应改为“安全保障部长”。\n\n  <178> 至 <710> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3037,"end":3045,"target_id":"43e53835484a994bc035f02efff920c378385063d84ae913158e72a3a6f244c9","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3045,"end":3077,"target_id":"4f3e9a98ba197d14d6e1ef89f938d73b3c74d2663bf5603775d688c1f6d2af08","source_hash":"a519f970907d80fc108d8947e92031f10c4d0762155b909dfe5d01543374cb67","text":"补充条款（政府组织法）<第12844号法令，2014年11月19日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3077,"end":3196,"target_id":"a489619eff886cd2d53d803e31cdc01361d8e442a8371e6ff4305711f77608a8","source_hash":"bb485e539c649e8835d14e3b1b139feba527f204c8e9fced9e458cc082dde578","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，根据附录第六条修正的法律中，修正在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律的条款，自该等法律各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3196,"end":3213,"target_id":"491e137a15414413dff71081407acb0038978ea7c1de23c474f984799cb5c51d","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00035","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3213,"end":3340,"target_id":"2ec01f2950933ff75cb83b7225b8825e086be82e7d1bc8bea7a828bf87844213","source_hash":"0333176077d0987663ab8ba12188284fd27fc8264251ed49be3f79038730a15b","text":"第六条（其他法律的修正）①至<85>款已省略\n\n  《促进新村运动组织法》部分修订如下。\n\n  第六条第一款中的“安全与公共管理部长”应改为“政府行政与内政部长”。\n\n  <87> 至 <258> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00036","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3340,"end":3348,"target_id":"17b1db17fc27d63c090f44d01dda7dfc71b5ec8b25e4971e9b23a84092b3e9d9","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00037","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3348,"end":3379,"target_id":"9808ad2d205a3916e8ce6292969e87ea13da657cb8d53f079c82f80d40e072d7","source_hash":"89d73ef846bf6ff580dd06ac1dbeb869ec8e8f9d99295a602fcc49a474c5bde9","text":"补充条款（政府组织法）<第14839号法令，2017年7月26日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00038","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3379,"end":3500,"target_id":"cedb85cc94b2cd8d326227008b7dc79a77ea76c1b34da69b9e5f19e2e3219b38","source_hash":"e7f048bc4b0ef4b04a065b53430b00744940cecd919f925823a150f1c549efd1","text":"第一条（生效日期）① 本法自公布之日起生效。但是，根据附录第五条修正的法律中，修正在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律的部分，自各法律的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00039","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3500,"end":3517,"target_id":"d365aa298b7ed791db905837ee548a902f6aa58df86cdab46b5a54b4a5dd9668","source_hash":"6ffda08faf109c176be482db4409396ced46b0373db22ad766c9b45cca3b755a","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00040","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3517,"end":3644,"target_id":"1b77e19f7989812b71e43117f85c3cf611e46d054fc3b919b0196eda60fc7307","source_hash":"f1fa87aa32239406a778b809373a03cb4f98f58e2ff48e58faf942f4048cd502","text":"第五条（其他法律的修正）①至<70>款已省略\n\n  《促进新村运动组织法》部分修订如下。\n\n  第六条第一款中的“政府行政和内政部长”应改为“内政和安全部长”。\n\n  <72> 至 <382> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00041","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3644,"end":3652,"target_id":"bf3004e5c0a9073957e5cbec27b6f47bf9c29b15502c6873cd9e7144618f13be","source_hash":"9b7ba4db40f54bc0237c77df55ff37ba785c3eedd3e841d5beefb1bf8efd6bb2","text":"第6条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00042","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001000-212141-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3652,"end":3695,"target_id":"427072c31e61df3f65122bed6ec50738724c35f0f95dd4dbe782a319b514682a","source_hash":"ae3e9e2d1f663258b6e9bdda4aa0834b93e44429c21390938dcdead32cbebc45","text":"补充规定 <第16766号，2019年12月10日>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。"},{"id":"B2-zh-00001","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":15,"target_id":"f0b63f2f7145a2136bfdd30837ab9f1e332aca403d98ad4ca4b6d172005f13b9","source_hash":"cb6eea9b597488c71741b1f3d793ba1095014b00357e401a515b5c80841c2e67","text":"《促进新村运动组织法》实施细则"},{"id":"B2-zh-00002","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":66,"target_id":"e284c127e45c8802af66a4f84d7c7055da696137eeb7f695df556eb7bc92b205","source_hash":"13bc6abdca7cf2c638e8172c8fc4474f4ab18b8bc188c61059c3a69b76d4d3b6","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定《促进新村运动组织法》所委托的事项以及为执行该法所必需的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00003","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":66,"end":86,"target_id":"a45d207753af5709a27c113645e8380bb03d0970729d559b3a7868b72053a737","source_hash":"5b4b13466a62eececfea15dadda94186453d00f229ab7acd7814c5b59b1d59f1","text":"删除文章 2 <2012.8.13>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00004","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":311,"target_id":"9889423daa5c903e862c2a4bd54ecd3045e2ec49c3f402bf15e74ff8182c6b47","source_hash":"882a57a38832622ed218cea37a1be008364a2a2927e5b5f5fac436bdd0404a74","text":"第三条（拨款申请） 根据《新村运动组织促进法》（以下简称“本法”）第三条第一款的规定，新村运动组织如欲获得政府拨款，应当于每年4月30日前向主管部长提交拨款申请，并附上下列各款所列文件。<2021年1月5日修订>\n1. 下一年度商业计划\n2. 下一年度预计损益表和预计资产负债表\n3. 其他必要文件，以澄清捐款请求的详情\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00005","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":311,"end":375,"target_id":"e6b9671729fbd9b479a6c2d6cf9c52ffe14bbe77f82d9c4ecc7c22384fa0f1d1","source_hash":"51fdf0cb14211d1bb00122116a46170bfc21384017ea6c59a67ff2024762bf5b","text":"第四条（预算确认通知） 捐款预算确认后，主管部长应当通知有关新村运动组织。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00006","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":375,"end":470,"target_id":"8a761159825142cfaa963ba27b833a60d45bd9f47108e01bddd578f06d4056cb","source_hash":"e391f3185cc9501a5bfa024fe47b085b5436458271c90b95d0ccec466e05c9e5","text":"第五条（缴纳会费申请）新村运动组织如欲领取会费，应向主管部长提交缴纳会费申请，并附上季度业务计划和季度预算执行计划。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00007","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":470,"end":540,"target_id":"53f69c9d95a997b18a686aee71d35e278e781ad95350504a090f2018d7464b22","source_hash":"23fe6e9a88f40bba483c374d5dcc41fd26999f3b93f7f4e72c9a2b9978202f89","text":"第六条（储备金管理）根据本法第三条第三款设立的储备金，应当通过设立单独的账户进行管理，并与其他费用区分开来。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00008","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":540,"end":643,"target_id":"a903de09668d3281f3eb03a5ee87338fdf03671cbebddba267d322be2cf6d414","source_hash":"6aab1128b18ad986b0ebc60c7ca32b345bb138e7c9611ada74cb9ad20d882d14","text":"第七条（盈余的处理）如果每个财政年度结算后出现盈余，新村运动组织应当用盈余来弥补结转的亏损，剩余部分结转到下一年或者转入储备基金。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00009","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":643,"end":1196,"target_id":"e9e25c3245f1e54ade7519242d6aebe79e050d446041d829fcf18036ce1b4b07","source_hash":"17952e14f84d0452e82a7f7ccac94abf36a4baaeb491851d8271dd864f7bd295","text":"第八条（国有公共财产租赁等的范围）\n① 根据该法第4条规定，国家或地方政府可以无偿租赁或转让国有或公共财产，或者允许其使用或享用的新村运动组织，其范围应为新村运动中央协会、新村领导人中央委员会、新村妇女协会中央联合会和工作场所新村运动中央委员会。\n② 根据第1款规定，有关无偿借贷、无偿转让或无偿使用和享用国有或公共财产的具体事项，应当由根据《国家财政法》第6条规定设立的中央机关负责人（以下简称“中央机关负责人”）或地方政府负责人与新村运动组织签订合同予以规定。\n③ 如果新村运动组织将根据本法第四条规定无偿租赁或取得的财产用于非预期用途，中央机关机关负责人或地方机关负责人可以取消合同或许可证。如果转让的财产在10年内被用于非预期用途，也适用同样的规定。\n4. 中央机关机关负责人或者地方机关机关负责人根据本法第四条规定，拟无偿出租、转让国有、公共财产，或者允许他人使用、享用该财产时，应当与有关财产的主管机关协商。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00010","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1196,"end":1323,"target_id":"6dee35beba5cddf82d10f99212adf2bf61b8a5c7d6bf66e28783e79e807d5355","source_hash":"dfd5f4cc42bd60d6fcbd5828feadb00c3b71dcae4ac2c1ef13bb3b8844e89b7e","text":"第九条（国家财产法等的适用）除本法令规定根据本法第四条对国有或公共财产的无偿租赁、无偿转让或无偿使用和享用事项外，国家财产法或公共财产和物品管理法的适用规定，比照适用。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00011","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1323,"end":1620,"target_id":"9fccee3e6b49de87911d4c669c750f522b0607573904af0c5952ad5946910830","source_hash":"a5c292289521f5304a14f8c9df8837c5a2e83ffbc30d4fe33a77f3f9428ce65b","text":"第十条（请求派遣新村运动人员）\n① 根据《新村运动法》第六条第一款，新村运动中央协会请求派遣新村运动人员时，应当向内政安全部长官提交派遣申请表，注明被派遣人员的所属单位、职级、姓名及其他个人信息，并送交相关机关、法人或组织负责人。<2013年3月23日、2014年11月19日、2017年7月26日修订>\n② 内政安全部长应当在第1款规定的派遣请求上附上意见，并将其送交相关机关、公司或组织的负责人。<2013年3月23日、2014年11月19日、2017年7月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00012","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1620,"end":1779,"target_id":"59f64dfd429e9c2124f0868b171f48419c9a17c3087775fbc60e3db92fae55fe","source_hash":"827fbedfd239df5145d02482249834b65fa40b6fcb88e0fb4f72c08e5cc98e25","text":"第11条（派遣人员的报酬等）  根据本法第6条规定派遣至韩国新村运动联合会的人员的派遣期限、报酬等事宜，由韩国新村运动联合会与派遣新村运动人员的机构、法人或组织协商确定。但是，有关派遣公职人员的相关法律法规如有特别规定，则适用该等规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00013","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1779,"end":1871,"target_id":"459fef566e7241452837380e36e9595aa1660e4e858adc461fc7fc3976063e6d","source_hash":"0f25cd32754c51bb43f121a6841328cba55eff0ff3db2746f4e9f2dfbabc78e8","text":"第十二条（派遣人员的服务）被派遣到新村运动中央协会的人员，应按照新村运动中央协会制定的规章，在派遣期间服务，并接受新村运动中央协会会长的指挥和监督。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00014","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1871,"end":2030,"target_id":"69b7c3611d9d176ccfe51a1e5be81b5dc84d593388671fb071a35f6d715e411a","source_hash":"b066f0f90ab7c18fe738e64b17e474b5d3be55d89b3e7847ca7b35c5531f4389","text":"第十三条（提交预算报告等）\n① 新村运动组织应当按照该法第9条的规定制定商业计划，将其分为目标、政策、重大项目和所需预算。\n② 根据第 1 款规定，在商业计划中变更重大项目细节时，必须具体说明变更原因和细节，并向主管部长报告。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00015","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2030,"end":2163,"target_id":"72fe03d212d1f7e474db6e89c0b3112905858100f29258dfba40bb4925952cd2","source_hash":"01245af626ae8d3363200a6653fdacc2f50b243dcfac5c578a49d3f291bbec16","text":"第十四条（结算报告）除经营业绩报告外，根据本法第十条规定，收支结算报告还应附下列文件。<2021年1月5日修订>\n1. 相关年度的损益表和资产负债表\n2. 其他可以阐明结算详情的材料\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00016","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2163,"end":2310,"target_id":"ba4fae837ab00f416200c6cbbe1ce33ad7440eb8343138550a6255dad7b3f78c","source_hash":"5842860b12965dcd807f34afd191e4c6b8fad761170783a1c522910cc1ca6729","text":"第十五条（适用规定）新村运动组织接受中央机关负责人或地方政府负责人（而非主管部长）的捐款时，第三条至第五条、第十三条和第十四条的规定应当比照适用。在此情况下，“主管部长”应当指“相关中央机关负责人或地方政府负责人”。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00017","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2310,"end":2354,"target_id":"7c6f6456cfbd82fae9976469a2e6ddba5be13049061e76383aca534cdb137558","source_hash":"77afa312354038f46191169a785435ffcc3419b949b6ef2ebebb6a392f6c8f84","text":"补充条款 <第10226号，1981年3月2日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00018","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2354,"end":2390,"target_id":"273fc1bfe9584748dd027266925c18b7477e1c7b05397c087d7bffe9c5d3a353","source_hash":"9e6889735fcdb351b62d283fee0f6dd970128dfb3731fda75d46ddee9484eb95","text":"补充文件（《国家财政法》实施令）<第19806号，2006年12月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00019","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2390,"end":2426,"target_id":"7799b43f648b15fa9f8091cbc601c95162a4245d55a48a5e0f91b2f0b89662f6","source_hash":"275bc3053ab7b4e9a7b7fe0ae2122b056897134926148da2fa3d5e2339a81baf","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2007年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00020","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2426,"end":2441,"target_id":"db2c015ed3875528f9e24e4540b032e0bd2c58b97c4dd682513b9d7ca0592153","source_hash":"119c19aa8cf5d20a95854f948299b43b564b2b8788981249c71d35dec8490177","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00021","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2441,"end":2572,"target_id":"eb270fb5feb8a32115a7e1677883c565add548dfe53e8354e02743ee51ea934a","source_hash":"0a04c28632efb1400674fe8078d49a9c26245a9d7dabe057121f99f126ec34fc","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<24> 已省略\n\n  《促进新村运动组织法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第十五条中，“预算会计法第九条第三款”应改为“国家财政法第六条第二款”。\n\n  <26> 至 <42> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00022","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2572,"end":2580,"target_id":"7ecbbfbd3cbe5c77e5437908029f25dd51dedecd46bd262d5bdb21fe044eac97","source_hash":"9b7ba4db40f54bc0237c77df55ff37ba785c3eedd3e841d5beefb1bf8efd6bb2","text":"第六条被省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00023","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2580,"end":2622,"target_id":"d258192e7aa4ecdfe9d82e76fd9d912064e50eea3368d8741d15779edbbbd709","source_hash":"044e85cd01389ab8ecb6cca7abc7cbb6c18ecb4cba15c33e90724344aa05b2a2","text":"增编（内政安全部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第20741号，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00024","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2622,"end":2659,"target_id":"f1b44814c9391eeea156a8991cbcb7004986f3e456fa6b4eb215bef0f1b09d81","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00025","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2659,"end":2676,"target_id":"1e85b32de9aa1cf9c8799fcaca051761524c2f301f9b7fe9072da8767c02b1b6","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00026","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2676,"end":2815,"target_id":"1b5c3d1568920af3aebba8915e1b963ebb1de23867e018b92a8d72df2ac94652","source_hash":"4489d4128152d8668a99b6ece5479fe872945445ef7b8aa395d425acdee58565","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<50> 已省略\n\n  <51>《促进新村运动组织法实施细则》部分修改如下。\n\n  第十条第一款和第二款中的“内政部长”应改为“内政安全部长”。\n\n  <52> 至 <105> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00027","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2815,"end":2859,"target_id":"c35f8f63b9d01c0e371726b4b6dd056dc9b1aaf0565c9cb5a2d3bbd958401580","source_hash":"8762ee798e153f363a8afeb43428a53614748ed6fc6aba5192af1913e4ee1820","text":"补充规定 <第24029号，2012年8月13日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00028","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2859,"end":2901,"target_id":"0e0fc793ba9f5153dd1cfe83d36c8c58cffe29943e3a304c3331aab76166f26d","source_hash":"875ab8aee4a83235873b291162119cdb344d6ba8382803dc8137e33dcb11d458","text":"增编（安全与公共管理部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2013年3月23日，第24425号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00029","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2901,"end":3026,"target_id":"c95c27cfedb235eb0c39fe258aac72c0604d19d4df965f00d09f1e1411b1a94e","source_hash":"43029911dc2de8ee3c18d3a0db5ea54e4a90b52bf432a54ad38d3946d19ff180","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第六条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00030","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3026,"end":3043,"target_id":"8fa03f70ea61e24b9ccae320f894f538f7e3b06e3f4dbc6c028ae93a9d1bd41e","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00031","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3043,"end":3184,"target_id":"44d048df63ceef2bad55e876f66d3c54ed9270e645ebb1a41ca1eb0488aa6c8f","source_hash":"25b379ad2b09054b24baa4a05784e44a4508b18e592cd1785e6d00084517aa7b","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<64> 已省略\n\n  65> 《促进新村运动组织法》实施细则部分修改如下。\n\n  第十条第一款和第二款中的“公共行政和安全部长”应改为“安全保障部长”。\n\n  <66> 至 <129> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00032","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3184,"end":3227,"target_id":"657dfe0c0548a582e10387dcb9a2ae6e78ac9591ec1cb0cdfe199eb1a4b12c4d","source_hash":"a3c47358b5319a3ba45787da785dfea890df8d8d79398cc9047d30e04f9d9dac","text":"增编（政府行政和内政部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2014年11月19日，第25751号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00033","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3227,"end":3352,"target_id":"d742e7b6ac2fa7132ac4f9f30737385cb10d6b88e800263e0858c8b2ceb2e495","source_hash":"ecc5937743f918230a397055273a1cd44275217a8341699c9b3693e458eb6e4c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第五条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00034","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3352,"end":3369,"target_id":"9e60605d7fe2729a289b0c1f45b172d864d3c07279214e1e8271bfba4a0134a7","source_hash":"6ffda08faf109c176be482db4409396ced46b0373db22ad766c9b45cca3b755a","text":"省略第2至4条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00035","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3369,"end":3514,"target_id":"98c690c8198707f40647a272670ab175dee029bb27d62ddfcb830ce03e3a8c5b","source_hash":"cbfab2eeea862a1776ed73e29e837579d0150bf6f82465bdde94a8e1b4216f33","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<174>款已省略\n\n  《促进新村运动组织法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。 \n\n  第十条第一款和第二款中的“安全与公共管理部长”应改为“政府行政与内政部长”。\n\n  <176> 至 <418> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00036","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3514,"end":3556,"target_id":"8a0e1c537ac28bc636da46bf1e960adbbb33edafee631b0ac7e49612860ac6c4","source_hash":"2229ee61688f381fa8791a317dce02e692966c0fc8dfff0224bc44e3cd9315a8","text":"增编（内政安全部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2017年7月26日，第28211号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00037","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3556,"end":3681,"target_id":"d187e4e544086acaf04a3e232656c72b2669e3055bb0e2003e085f1dca0934df","source_hash":"e322c6bccc7dc02efb62fdad6a23702463436edc72b2f2f5029c536f3946505e","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第八条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自该等总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00038","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3681,"end":3698,"target_id":"f5e656e1e15506e5088aa85bf251e874e05b23809353f59039953125d7d50ad3","source_hash":"d9985315e81c5ba7d5516a248b6bd3f949098433ce3c6da60edc74f7499d0a05","text":"省略第2至7条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00039","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3698,"end":3842,"target_id":"3325ca6bbe343282a31661c8a4e4e75d7ec7dcfd14e5d3b58107a564a03aeb74","source_hash":"f57a77bf468603715cbbc4c98f7d7a455d00d052a817d7aa98c2e2f1fb66194c","text":"第八条（修改其他法律）①至<137>款已省略\n\n  《促进新村运动组织法》实施细则部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第十条第一款和第二款中的“政府行政和内政部长”应改为“公共行政和安全部长”。\n\n  <139> 至 <388> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00040","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003831-227573-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3842,"end":3931,"target_id":"d3ad151fa7d6cec950fab0edf9aa815241fdbd0ea29bc78c8f3eff7ebaf27025","source_hash":"5acf6528a15b33c8301c4277779248bda41fd736f7084f79fe2dba487eee1630","text":"增补（关于部分修订473项法律以规范复杂法律术语的总统令）<第31380号，2021年1月5日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。<但书略>"}]}